Short:        Version 2 of the dbtools library.
Author:       henriki@pluggnet.se (Henrik Isaksson)
Uploader:     henriki pluggnet se (Henrik Isaksson)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

The dbtools.library provides an easy way to create saveable databases.
With just one command You can save or load all the data your application
needs.
The databases can be loaded, saved, searched and in V3 (=soon) sorted.
